    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1914, the village of Amherst Junction had become an important buying and shipping center for potatoes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amherst_Junction%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Travelers once detrained in Amherst Junction and hired rigs from local liveries to reach eastern and northeastern parts of the county.",
